# Mouse cradle, cut at z = -80 ... +80 mm, in polyethylene.
# I derived it from the rat cradle: its cross-section scaled by 0.487 (outer radius about 17 mm), the axial
# dimensions unchanged. The real mouse cradle has solid side walls about 3 mm thick, so I changed the
# scaled shape as follows (the STL files were made with a script that is not included):
#  * floor (below the floor top, y = -12.055 mm in the cradle's own frame): as scaled, channels included;
#  * side walls: same shape, inclination and inner surface as the scaled cradle, with the gaps and notches
#    of the outer surface closed (outer surface = convex envelope of the scaled cross-section). The steep
#    drop from the wall to the floor (below y = -8 mm) is rounded, so the wall is 3 mm thick there and the
#    flat top of the floor is |x| < about 6.4 mm.
#    The largest radius is that of the scaled cradle, so it fits both coils.
#  * material: Bed_HDPE (polyethylene C2H4, 0.95 g/cm3, defined in Coil3Bed.db), the same as the rat cradle.
#    It is an assumption: the real cradles are white and opaque, probably polyethylene. For another
#    material, change the 10 setMaterial lines (e.g. POM 1.41 g/cm3, nylon 1.14 g/cm3).
# 10 parts (stl_mbed3mm/). Every part is placed at (0, {cradleY}, {sourceZ}); both aliases are set in the
# main macro, so the cradle moves with the source along z. Every part attaches its own PhantomSD.

/gate/world/daughters/name mbed3mm_s0087
/gate/world/daughters/insert tessellated
/gate/mbed3mm_s0087/geometry/setPathToSTLFile coil_bed_real/stl_mbed3mm/mbed3mm_s0087.stl
/gate/mbed3mm_s0087/setMaterial Bed_HDPE
/gate/mbed3mm_s0087/placement/setTranslation 0 {cradleY} {sourceZ} mm
/gate/mbed3mm_s0087/vis/setColor white
/gate/mbed3mm_s0087/attachPhantomSD

/gate/world/daughters/name mbed3mm_s0088
/gate/world/daughters/insert tessellated
/gate/mbed3mm_s0088/geometry/setPathToSTLFile coil_bed_real/stl_mbed3mm/mbed3mm_s0088.stl
/gate/mbed3mm_s0088/setMaterial Bed_HDPE
/gate/mbed3mm_s0088/placement/setTranslation 0 {cradleY} {sourceZ} mm
/gate/mbed3mm_s0088/vis/setColor white
/gate/mbed3mm_s0088/attachPhantomSD

